# Node: atomic.ByBuiltinRewrite.OrderDual
# Run: LITEX_NEW_PIPELINE=1 litex -f examples/new_pipeline_proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rewrite/order_dual.lit
#
# Uses variables so ClosedNumericComparison cannot prove `b > a` first.
# After other search slots miss, OrderDual rewrites to `a < b` (known) with
# can_use_rewrite = false.

have a R, b R
trust a < b
b > a
